Package: pelagicOM
Type: Package
Title: Spatio-Temporal Operating Model for Pelagic Stocks and Longline Fisheries
Version: 0.1.1
Date: 2026-11-22
Authors@R:
    person("Rodrigo", "Sant'Ana", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "rsantana@univali.br")
Description: Simulates a completely known operating truth for testing CPUE
    standardisation: (i) the spatio-temporal biomass of a pelagic stock on
    a 1x1 degree grid (Pella-Tomlinson total biomass, latitudinal habitat
    envelope, hotspots, persistent and spatio-temporal Gaussian random
    fields, poleward redistribution) and (ii) set-by-set pelagic longline
    operations on top of it (fleets, vessels with careers, trips, sets,
    preferential sampling and fidelity, latent fishing strategies, hooks and
    hooks between floats, catchability components including creep, Tweedie
    catches, companion species), plus observation processes and scenario data
    sets. Ships the ICCAT 1x1 grid with the membership of every ICCAT stock
    area. The 'BET_ICCAT' preset reproduces exactly the bigeye tuna operating
    model of Experimento 02 (workshop tRFMO CPUE, 2026).
